<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68706" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονο-φῠής</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μουνο-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>single</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.83
				</span></i>
			; of bodily organs, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μὲν μ. καθάπερ καρδία καὶ πλεύμων,
					τὰ δὲ διφυῆ καθάπερ νεφροί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					669b13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦτρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					493a19
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυσχιδής</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				673b17
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); of trees or herbs, <i>with a single stem</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.6.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.114
			</span></i>; of mountains, <i>with a single summit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.8.11
			</span></i>.</div>
